<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n80153" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παχν-όω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>congeal, solidify</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.396b
			</span></i> :—
				Pass.
			, ib.<i><span class="en">
				736a
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πεπαχνῶσθαι</span>”
				<i>to be covered with rime,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gp.
					12.17.1
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph.,
				<i>strike chill</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπάχνωσεν φίλον
				ἦτορ</span>
			<i>made</i> his blood <i>curdle</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Op.</u>
				360
			</span></i> :— mostly in 
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἦτορ παχνοῦται</span> his
			heart <i>is cold and stiff</i> [with grief], <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				17.112
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παχνοῦσθαι πένθεσιν,
			λύπῃ</span>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ch.</u>
				83
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hipp.</u>
				803
			</span></i> : in later Prose, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπαχνώθη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>BJ</u>
					1.28.3
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
